The same ShelterSplit repo, deployed on Tempo mainnet (chain 4217) against USDC.e using TIP-20 transferWithMemo receipts, with the Arc deployment shown alongside. What is submitted:
- a 2-3 min pitch video (on camera);
- a demo video of 3 min or less (reuses the Arc video footage);
- a GTM section: consumer app distribution plus shelter onboarding;
- disclosure of work done before the window (ShelterSplit was written 2026-09-27, inside the Sep 14 - Oct 12 window; the older app is disclosed as prior work).

Pitched as the stablecoin donation rail for pet rescue, a payment application (the category Colosseum's resources manifest lists for Tempo).

Ask in the Colosseum Discord whether one submission can also be tagged for the Arbitrum track (5 x $5k). If yes, add an Arbitrum One deploy (cheap, from the same wave).
